---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="Learn what Kreativ Auto is, how the site is written, and what readers should expect from it.">
  <div class="container-shell py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="surface p-8 sm:p-10">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl">What Kreativ Auto is here to do</h1>
      <div class="mt-6 max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-base leading-7 text-steel">
        <p>Kreativ Auto is built for people who want clearer answers about car problems, maintenance, and replacement parts.</p>
        <p>The goal is simple: make automotive content easier to trust, easier to scan, and more useful when someone is trying to decide what to check, what to fix, or what to buy.</p>
        <p>This site focuses on practical guidance, not hype. That means better explanations, clearer comparisons, and a stronger bias toward helping readers make a sensible decision.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
